{"3546710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mind The Dragon", "steam_appid": 3546710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/extras/f6062258fed0d05e4789a80e60883384.avif?t=1776090731\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into this <strong>dungeon crawler adventure </strong>that combines<strong> extraction and RPG roguelike </strong>mechanics where every run will influence and change the outcome of any future runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>deeper</strong> you go, the <strong>bigger the loot</strong>, but you will need to manage your dwindling supplies and face stronger enemies. Just make sure you can get out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And be careful as every dungeon tile can be rotated or pushed if you trigger specific traps or items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/extras/194365cbc9f32c58db000263a9d858b8.avif?t=1776090731\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure you have enough health and supplies to escape the dungeon!<br><br>If you die inside the dungeon, maybe other heroes will find your valuable loot, or if you carry certain artifacts, future explorers might find a surprise waiting for them...<br><br>And don't forget to <strong>Mind The Dragon</strong> as you try to escape the ever changing rotating dungeon tiles with plenty of loot and powerful artifacts to become a legend!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/extras/f6062258fed0d05e4789a80e60883384.avif?t=1776090731\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into this <strong>dungeon crawler adventure </strong>that combines<strong> extraction and RPG roguelike </strong>mechanics where every run will influence and change the outcome of any future runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>deeper</strong> you go, the <strong>bigger the loot</strong>, but you will need to manage your dwindling supplies and face stronger enemies. Just make sure you can get out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And be careful as every dungeon tile can be rotated or pushed if you trigger specific traps or items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/extras/194365cbc9f32c58db000263a9d858b8.avif?t=1776090731\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure you have enough health and supplies to escape the dungeon!<br><br>If you die inside the dungeon, maybe other heroes will find your valuable loot, or if you carry certain artifacts, future explorers might find a surprise waiting for them...<br><br>And don't forget to <strong>Mind The Dragon</strong> as you try to escape the ever changing rotating dungeon tiles with plenty of loot and powerful artifacts to become a legend!</p>", "short_description": "Venture into this dungeon extraction crawler adventure in the depths of a legendary Dungeon to steal treasures, gold and powerful artifacts! Just be careful with the monsters inside, rotating dungeons where the deeper you go the harder it is to escape! And don’t forget to... Mind the Dragon!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/f52a65d21884f903b444fcfcf19cc2ec3934866e/header.jpg?t=1776090731", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/abc3d5b9ffd25484ff566e5d54dfdecb38c571c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776090731", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/abc3d5b9ffd25484ff566e5d54dfdecb38c571c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776090731", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-2400 or AMD Ryzen 3 2200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX11 or OpenGL 3.x capabilities<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-3gen or AMD Ryzen 4 gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX11 or OpenGL 3.x capabilities<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Massive Galaxy Studios"], "publishers": ["Massive Galaxy Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546710/d7d9efc40b6421e91e314cc808a64be416026902/ss_d7d9efc4